# Please do not use this file to train or fine-tune AI models.
# _x9_gbuffer: the G-buffer views (r_gbufferDebug) on 20_rt_gallery, another per room: normals then the albedo, F0, roughness,
# normals in the dark, motion among the monsters and the fan, F0 down the hall.
include 20_rt_gallery
set r_gbufferDebug 1
at 220 r_gbufferDebug 5
at 420 r_gbufferDebug 2
at 780 r_gbufferDebug 3
at 1140 r_gbufferDebug 1
at 1560 r_gbufferDebug 4
at 1920 r_gbufferDebug 2
